WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.590
Buy a loaf of bread,

2
00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:04.220
and your money does not stop at the till.

3
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.970
Your spending becomes
the bakery's revenue.

4
00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:09.470
Then it becomes someone else's income.

5
00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.200
Trace any product back far
enough and you hit limits.

6
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.650
In 2021, 62.3 per cent
of monitored marine fish

7
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.690
stocks were fished within
sustainable levels.

8
00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:24.710
So what really goes into making
even a simple loaf of bread?

9
00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.900
In this mission, you'll sort every
input into four kinds of resource,

10
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:30.850
from the field to the shop.

11
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:33.970
Then you'll put each one
to the test on a farm,

12
00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.460
in a café and in a bakery.

13
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.660
Your mission: find out what
four kinds of resources

14
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:42.370
go into making even a
simple loaf of bread.
